Code License (Future)
======================

Code under `sdk/` and `reference/` is not yet published. When it is,
it will be licensed separately — most likely under Apache License
2.0 or the MIT License — because normative specification text and
implementation code are different kinds of artifact and are not
expected to share a license by default. The applicable code license
will be stated in a `LICENSE` file within each of those directories
once populated, and will not retroactively apply to specification
text.
